_SWkMMxnXvR8qzyzyL0NZYCmtfVeu4KqoWWA&oe=6ABBC3DF"}, {"file_name": "rg2.png", "id": "1634657963894104", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819337_1634657970560770_475267020735720819_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Sa51Dr74Dz4Q7kNvwHVJtmJ&_nc_oc=AdrLxkBIktsl8NTVkra6Cf4iIgleSK8a_OVCLfrakIbX0u31l_rI1HSnDF8UTu_cne4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIIK8pelx7MtVnc-EHEH_SQy1UwzCEDVz1l4UF8xmJVHw&oe=6ABBD3E9"}, {"file_name": "rg4ZZ.png", "id": "1269736414511182", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819315_1269736417844515_273496829688142764_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yDbwXApWgA0Q7kNvwENdt4U&_nc_oc=AdrH20fdWkLo61Y8maRUOjGkQ7zNMgrgPw5M0OrpsVLw9VAztWEwRIfCISBmGQQdta8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJLDcOMjlyYT7bQ7WWG3fW9837tNVEx5aRyX9Li2orDyQ&oe=6ABBD946"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscapeV2.png", "id": "1487801955983071", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822883_1487801959316404_5717692708207696641_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AaM6dMpIQk0Q7kNvwEJRk5R&_nc_oc=AdpGPUwt0TBgI94xc5GnnCa1clBJz74oYrqq7lS-wlkrAiQZDvHaBKL_iBm4re6ILag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJOIZT3cFa404IVrmQ5uZY8292ZWkWbFgRAVf2umYn31w&oe=6ABBD6C6"}, "display_name": "RogueGods Demo", "keywords": ["TCG", "cards", "deckbuilder", "strategy", "roguelike"], "long_description": "# FREE DEMO of RogueGods \u2014 Act I\n\nA deck-building roguelite for VR & MR where every card transforms into a weapon you wield, a spell, a power, or even an ally. Build your deck, combine magic rings, and ascend Olympus.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 **Indie finalist : Pucela Game Awards \u00b7 IRIS Game Awards**\n\n# Features\n\n-  **Build a living deck:**\n\nDiscover hundreds of cards. Choose wisely and create unstoppable synergies to crush your enemies.\n{1106163998270701}\n\n-  **Physical, tactical, turn-based combat in XR:**\n\nSummon allies, cast spells and throw weapons with your hands in VR or MR against the hordes of the underworld. Feel the power!\n{4189033177999902}\n\n-  **Magic rings:**\n\nDiscover and equip rings with powers that reshape your strategy.\n{620687614448547}\n\n-  **Infinite replayability:**\n\nA path that never repeats. Procedural maps with shops, mysteries, loot, duels\u2026 Every 20\u201340 min run is different.\n{632847616218480}\n\n-  **Epic adventure:**\n\nHeroes with unique decks and fighting styles; Olympian gods, mythic characters, and enemies such as centaurs, griffins, and cyclopes.\n{1415126163124006}\n\n# \ud83d\udea8 The full game launches December 2026\n\nThe complete ascent to Olympus with Acts II & III \u00b7 3 new heroes \u00b7 300+ cards \u00b7 100+ rings \u00b7 50+ unique enemies.\n\n\u2b50 Wishlist the full game:\nhttps://www.meta.com/experiences/23922241070805612/\n\n\ud83d\udcac Discord: discord.com/invite/EHMGuTesvK\n\nMaster Heracles in the Act I demo. Build your deck, gear up, and forge your legend. Do you accept the challenge?", "short_description": "FREE DEMO of Act I: play as Heracles.\n\nA single-player roguelite deckbuilder for VR & MR. Every card becomes a weapon you wield, a spell, a power, or an ally. Pick wisely from hundreds of cards, chain synergies, equip magic rings, and ascend Olympus in turn-based battles. Procedural maps and 20\u201340 min runs that never repeat.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Indie finalist: Pucela Game Awards \u00b7 IRIS Game Awards\n\ud83d\udcc5 Full game: December 2026"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1966541454026389", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RogueGods Demo", "keywords": ["deckbuilder", "cartas", "roguelike", "estrategia", "mitologia"], "long_description": "# DEMO GRATUITA de RogueGods: Acto I con Heracles.\n\nRoguelite de construcci\u00f3n de mazos en VR y MR, donde cada carta se transforma en un arma que empu\u00f1as, en hechizos, en poderes o incluso en aliados.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Finalista mejor juego indie: Premios IRIS Games y Pucela Game Awards\n\n# Caracter\u00edsticas\n\n-  **Crea tu mazo con cartas que cobran vida:**\n\nDescubre cientos de cartas para tu baraja. Elige con astucia y crea sinergias imparables para arrasar a tus enemigos.\n{1079978670828011}\n\n- **Combates f\u00edsicos y t\u00e1cticos por turnos en XR:**\n\nInvoca aliados y lanza hechizos y armas con tus manos en VR o MR contra las hordas del inframundo.\n{1130240195699699}\n\n-  **Anillos m\u00e1gicos:**\n\nDescubre y equipa anillos con poderes que transforman tu estrategia.\n{631228943079714}\n\n-  **Rejugabilidad infinita:**\n\nMapas procedurales con tiendas, misterios, botines y duelos. Cada partida (20-40 min) es distinta.\n{772785808675821}\n\n-  **Aventura \u00e9pica:**\n\nH\u00e9roes con mazos y estilos de lucha \u00fanicos; dioses ol\u00edmpicos, personajes mitol\u00f3gicos y enemigos como centauros, grifos y c\u00edclopes.\n{4157364621184477}\n\n# \ud83d\udea8 El juego completo sale en diciembre de 2026\n\nAscenso completo al Olimpo con los Actos II y III \u00b7 3 h\u00e9roes nuevos \u00b7 300+ cartas \u00b7 100+ anillos \u00b7 50+ enemigos \u00fanicos.\n\n\u2b50 Lista de deseos del juego completo:\nhttps://www.meta.com/experiences/23922241070805612/\n\n\ud83d\udcac Discord: discord.com/invite/EHMGuTesvK\n\nDomina a Heracles en la demo del Acto I. \u00a1Crea tu mazo, equ\u00edpate y forja tu leyenda! \u00bfAceptas el desaf\u00edo?", "short_description": "DEMO GRATUITA del Acto I: juega como Heracles.\n\nRoguelite de construcci\u00f3n de mazos en VR y MR. Cada carta se transforma en un arma que empu\u00f1as, en hechizos, poderes o aliados. Elige entre cientos de cartas, combina sinergias, equipa anillos m\u00e1gicos y asciende al Olimpo en combates por turnos. Mapas procedurales y partidas de 20-40 min que nunca se repiten.